<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">Uruti Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Uruti Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Uruti Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Uru</para>
  <para style="mt1">Uruti Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Uruti taarikey saroteththi kumida taarike; Daannata Maxaafan yootettida makkallanchchata wode ha taarikezi xaafettides. Mo7aabe dere as Uruta Isra7eele asaappe issaa geladus. Izi azinay hayqqiin Isra7eele dere as gidida ba bolloteys keehi malalisiza ammaneteth bessadus. Hessaththoka qasse GODAA Isra7eele Xoossaa keeha siiqadus. Wurseththan beni ba azinaa dabbotappe issaa geladus. Hessan Isra7eele biittan gita kawo gidida Dawites ma7e gidanaas qaada demmadus.</para>
  <para style="ip">Daannata Maxaafan diza taariketi Xoossa asay Xoossafe haakkida gaason istta gakkida bashshaa besseettes. Uruti Maxaafan diza taarikey ba wozina Isra7eele Xoossaako zaarida issi allaga maccassaya anjjettidayssanne ammanettida iza asaappe issineyo gida qoodettana dandaydayssa bessees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Nuhaama Urutira Beeteliheeme simo <char style="ior"><ref loc="RUT 1:1-22">1:1-22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Boo7eezera Uruti erateth <char style="ior"><ref loc="RUT 2:1-3:18">2:1—3:18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Boo7eezey Uruto machcho eko <char style="ior"><ref loc="RUT 4:1-22">4:1-22</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Abimelekke Bete Buus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />Isra7eele biittaa daannati haariza wode he biittan koshay dendides. Histtiin issaadey ba machchonne nam7u attuma nayta ekkidi Yuhuda deren diza Beeteliheeme katamappe dendidi Mo7aabe biitta bides. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />He addeza sunththi Abimelekke; machchey sunththi Nuhaamo;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nuhaamo guussi Ibraaweta qaalara Ufayssizayssa guussa.</char></note> nam7u nayta sunththi Mahaloonenne Keloone geetettees. Istti Yuhuda biittan Beeteliheeme kataman Efraata dere as gidishe Mo7aabe dere biidi heen de7ida.<verse eid="RUT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Heen dishin Nuhaami azina Abimelekkey hayqqiin iza ba naa nam7atara xalla attadus. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Izi nayti Mo7aabe biitta macca naytappe Orfanne Uruto machcho ekkida. Isttika heen tammu layththa keena de7ida. <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />Mahalooneynne Kelooney nam7atikka hayqqida. Nuhaama izi azinaynne nam7u nayti hayqqiin barkka attadus.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nuhaama Urutira Beeteliheeme Simma Buus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Iza Mo7aaben dishin GODAY ba asaa mokki xeellidi isttas kath immidayssa siyada nayta machcheta nam7ata banara ekkada ba dere simma baana kezadus. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Kase ba dizaso yeggada nayta machcheta nam7atara issife Yuhuda biitta efiza ogen gelidi buus doommida.<verse eid="RUT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Hessafe guye Nuhaama ba nayta machcheta nam7atas, «Intte wurikka intte aayikko aayikko simmite; hayqqida intte azinatassinne taas intte lo7o ooththidayssaththo GODAYKKA inttes izaththo ooththo. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Intte issoy issoy gelana azinason GODAY inttes woppa immo» gaada istta yeeradus.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 1:9">Istti ba qaala dhoqqu histtidi yeekkida; <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />qasseka isttika izis, «Nuni nenara ne asaakko baana» gida.<verse eid="RUT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Nuhaama isttas, «Ta naytoo guye intteso simmite; intte tanara ays beetii? Inttes azina gidana attuma nayta ta buro yelanaa inttes misatizee? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Ta naytoo tani hara azina gelontta mala keeha cimadis; tani hach azina gelada attuma naa yelizaakkoka, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />istti dicci gakkanaashe intte istta naaganee? Istta naagishe intte azina gelontta gam7anee? Ta naytoo, hessi hanenna; GODAA kushey ta bolla dendida gishshas hayssi ha yo7oy inttefe bollara taas camo» gadus.<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Hessa gishshas istti ba qaala dhoqqu histtidi qasseka yeekkida. Histtiin Orfay ba bolloteyo yeera ekkada simmadus. Gido attiin Uruta izippe shaakettana koyontta gishshas izo idimma oykkada yeddontta ixxadus. <verse eid="RUT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Nuhaama izis zaarada, «Beya, ne azina ishaa machcheya ba asataakkonne ba eeqa xoossatakko simmadus. Nenikka izira simma ba» gadus.<verse eid="RUT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Gido attiin Uruta zaarada, «Tani neeppe shaakettana mala woykko nena aggada guye simmana mala tana waayisoppa. Neni bizaso awakka ta baana; neni dizason awanka ta daana; ne asay ta as gidana; ne Xoossi ta Xoos gidana. <verse eid="RUT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Ne hayqqizason ta hayqqana; heenkka tani moogettana; hayqoppe attiin haray tana neeppe shaakkiko GODAY ta bolla pirdo; hessafekka bollara hara iita izi ta bolla ooththo» gadus.<verse eid="RUT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Uruta izira baanaas ba qofaa qachchidayssa Nuhaama erida wode ba gizayssa aggada co7u gadus.<verse eid="RUT 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Hessafe guye nam7atikka Beeteliheeme gakkanaas issife bida. Istti Beeteliheeme gakkiza wode he katama asay wuri istta hanotaan malalettides. Qasse maccassati, «Hanna Nuhaamii?» gida.<verse eid="RUT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Iza zaarada isttas, «Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossi ta duussaa daro cameththida gishshas tana, ‹Camoyee!› giite attiin, ‹Nuhaamee› goopite. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Tani kumeth kezadis shin GODAY tana mela kushe zaarides. GODAY tana un7eththides; Ubbaa Dandayza GODAY ta bolla iita miish gaththides. Histtiin tana ays Nuhaamee gi xeygeetii?» gadus.<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Hessafe guye Nuhaama ba naa machcho Urutira Mo7aabeppe simmadus. Istta banggay maxa doomettishin Beeteliheeme gakkida.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Piixe Shiishshanaas Uruti Buus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Nuhaamis izi azina Abimelekke baggara dabbotiza Boo7eeze geetettiza issi erettida dure asi dees. <verse eid="RUT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Issi gallas Mo7aabe dere as Uruta Nuhaamo, «Ta iza sinththan puulattiin tana piixe shiishshisana as demmiko ane tani iza kaththi maxettizaso bays» gadus. Nuhaamakka zaarada izis, «Ee ta nayee ba» gadus.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:9-10">Lewe 19:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:19">Zaare 24:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="RUT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Histtiin Uruta baada kath maxiza asaa guyeppe piixe shiisho doommadus; iza piixeza shiishshiza gadey Abimelekke dabbo Boo7eeze gade. <verse eid="RUT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />He wodekka Boo7eezey Beeteliheeme katamappe gakki wodhdhidi kath maxiza asaa, «GODAY inttes wolqqa immo» gides. Isttika zaaridi, «GODAY anjjo» gida.<verse eid="RUT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Histtiin Boo7eezey kath maxizaytas kaabboza, «Hanna naateththa naya oonaarii?» gi oychchides.<verse eid="RUT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Kaabbozi zaaridi, «Hanna Nuhaamira yida Mo7aabe dere macca naa. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Iza tana, ‹Kath maxizayta geedo kaallada mirqqe giddofe wodhdhida piixe shiishshoo?› gaada oychchadus. Histtada guuththa wode kuwattana shempoorippe attiin maaladoppe doommada ha7i gakkanaas piixashe gam7adus» gides.<verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Histtiin Boo7eezey Uruto, «Ta nayee siya; piixe shiishshanaas hara asa gade booppa; qasse hayssafe awakka qaaxxofa; taas ooththiza macca naytara hayssan pe7a. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Attuma asati maxizaso xeellada macca nayta kaalla; addeti nena bochchontta mala tani isttas yootadis; nena saamizaa gidikko addeti ehi woththida haaththaafe duuqqa duuqqa uya» gides. <verse eid="RUT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Uruta ba hu7e biitta gaththa ziggada, «Tani asa dere as gidikkinaa? Ne taas mishettana mala ta waana ne sinththan saba demmadinaa?» gadus.<verse eid="RUT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Boo7eezey zaaridi, «Ne azinay hayqqoosoppe neni ne bolloteys ooththida miish ubbaa ta siyadis. Qasse neni ne aayo, ne aawaanne ne yelettida biitta aggada hayssafe kase ne erontta deraara daanaas yidayssi taas yootettides. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Neni ooththidayssa kushe GODAY nees zaaro. Neni iza qefe garsan attanaas yida GODAA Isra7eele Xoossay nees dakko immo» gides.<verse eid="RUT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Uruta, «Ta godoo, ta puulateththi ne sinththan gujetti gujetti bides; tani ne oosanchchatappe issiney mala gidikke shin ne taas lo7o haasayada tana keeha minththeththadasa» gadus.<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Quma mishin Boo7eezey izo, «Haa shiiqa; ukeththaa ekkada usttara ma» gides; histtiin iza kath maxizaytara shiiqa uttadus; histtidi izis tiya hallahas immides; iza kallanaashe gakkanaas madus; qumazikka palahides.<verse eid="RUT 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Qasseka iza piixeza shiishshanaas dendiza wode Boo7eezey ba oosanchchata, «Mirqqeza garsafekka iza qorikko izo yeellachchofte. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Mirqqezappeka shoddidi izis yeggiko iza qoru; izo hanqofte» gides.<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Heen Uruta omars gakkanaas piixeza zam7iin tammu kilo gidanaazi kezides. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Iza he kaththaa ba7a ekkada katama simmadus; ay gina kath shiishshidaakko izi bolloteya be7adus; qasseka Uruta kase mishin tirpi attidayssa izis kessa immadus.<verse eid="RUT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Histtiin izi bolloteya izo, «Hach awan piixa pe7adii? Awan ooththa pe7adii? Nees hayssa kiya ooththidayssi anjjetto» gadus.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:19">Histtiin Uruta oonas ooththa pe7idaakko ba bolloteys, «Tani hach piixashe pe7ida gade goday Boo7eeze» ga yootadus.<verse eid="RUT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Nuhaama ba naaza machcheys ba lo7eteththaa, «Hayqqidayta bollanne paxa dizayta bolla lo7o ooso aggontta GODAY iza anjjo» gadus. Kaaleththadakka, «He addezi nuus asho dabbo; nuna laatti ayssanaas bessiza asaappe issoy iza» gadus.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:25">Lewe 25:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="RUT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Qasseka Mo7aabe dere as Uruta, «Izi tana, ‹Ta kaththaa maxi wursanaashe gakkanaas ta oosanchchatappe shaakettontta piixa› gides» gadus.<verse eid="RUT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Nuhaama ba naaza machcho Uruto, «Ta nayee, hessi nees lo7o; macca oosanchcha izaytara buussi nees lo7o; gaasoykka hara asa gade ne biikko addeti nena bochchana» gadus.<verse eid="RUT 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Hessa gishshas Uruta Boo7eeze macca oosanchchatakko shiiqada banggaynne gisttey maxetti wurana gakkanaas piixashe gam7adus. Qasse ba bolloteyra issife de7adus.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Uruti Gelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Issi gallas Nuhaama ba naaza machchiyo Uruto, «Ta nayee ne lo7o duus daana mala ta nees koyanaas bessennee? <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Neni isttara gam7ida macca oosanchchati izas kiitettiza Boo7eezey nuna ashon laattiza dabbo. Haa siya, izi hach omars balen bangga bukkana. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Neni meecettada, shitto tiyettadanne lo7o may7o may7ada izi bukkiza bale ba; gido attiin baada Boo7eezey miidinne uyidi simmana gakkanaas iza ayfen beettofa. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Izi ichchizaso lo7eththa xeellada izas tohosora afala qaarada iza tohoson ichcha; hessafe guye ne hananayssa izi nees yootana» gadus.<verse eid="RUT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Histtiin Uruta, «Ne gidayssa ubbaa ta ooththana» gadus. <verse eid="RUT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Hessa gishshas Uruta duge baleza baada izi bolloteya izis yootidayssa ubbaa ooththadus.<verse eid="RUT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Boo7eezey mi uyidi ufayettidaappe guye kaththa doore achchan ichchides; histtiin Uruta loddara izakko shiiqada iza afala tohosora qaarada tohoson ichchadus. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Giddi giddoth gidishin issi miishshi addeza daganththiin izi shirettishin issi maccassi iza tohosora ichchidaaro demmides.<verse eid="RUT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Izikka izo, «Hanne ne oonee?» gi oychchiin iza, «Tani ne oosanchchayo Uruto; tana laattana bessiza mata dabboy nena gidida gishshas ne may7o macara tana mayza» gadus.<verse eid="RUT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Boo7eezey zaaridi, «Ta nayee, GODAY nena anjjo! Hayssafe kase ne ooththoyssafe ha7i ne ooththoyssi aadhdhees. Dure gidiin woykko manqo yelaga attuma koshshu babeekka. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Ha7ikka ta nayee babbofa; neni oychchidayssa ubbaa ta nees ooththana; gaasoykka ta dere asay wuri neni lo7o haniza maccas gididayssa erees. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />Tani laata dabbo gidikkoka nena laattanaas taappe matiza hara dabboy dees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 2:20">Uru 2:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Ha7i hayssan aqa; bitanezi nena laattana koykko lo7o; izi nena laattana koyontta aggiko ta nees GODAAN caaqqays ta laata ekkana; gadey wonttana gakkanaas hayssan ichcha» gides.<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Hessa gishshas Uruta gadey wonttana gakkanaas iza tohoson ichchadus; Boo7eezey, «Maccassi kaththa bale yidayssa oonikka eroppo» gida gishshas Uruta asi as shaakki erontta saaten koyrotta dendadus. <verse eid="RUT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Boo7eezey izo, «Ne bollara may7ida may7oza haa bessa» gides. Iza bessiin nam7u tammu kilo gidiza bangga makki qolidi izo ba7issides. Izakka ba7ada katama badus.<verse eid="RUT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Uruta ba bolloteyko biin Nuhaama izo, «Ta nayee ne bida yo7oy waanidee?» ga oychchiin, Uruta Boo7eezey izis ooththidayssa ubbaa yootadus; <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Qasseka, « ‹Ne bolloteyko mela kushe booppa› giidi hayssa 20 kilo bangga taas immides» gadus.<verse eid="RUT 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Nuhaamakka izo, «Ta nayee, buro aazi hananaakko erettana gakkanaas naagaashsha; addezi yo7oza hach wursontta shempenna» gadus.<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Boo7eezey katamaa penge achchan diza dubbushaa kezidi heen uttides. Izi utti dishin izi kase iza gishshas yootida laata dabboy heera aadhdhizayssa be7idi, «Ta ishawu! Haa simmada hayssan utta» giin addezi simmidi uttides. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Boo7eezey he katamaa cimatappe tammu asata xeygidi, «Hayssan uttite» gi utisides. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Hessafe guye Boo7eezey laatas bessiza mata dabbozas, «Mo7aabe biittafe simma yida Nuhaama nu ishaa Abimelekke xinxxo gadeza bayzana gawus. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Ne hessa erana mala ta qoppida gishshas ha7i hayssan diza asaa sinththaninne ta deraa cimata sinththan gadeza ne shammana mala ta nena qofsana koyadis; ne wozzana koykko wozzanaas dandayaasa; neeppe kasetanaas bessiza hara asi deenna; ne hessa ooththontta aggiko neeppe kaallidi taas bessiza gishshas ta erana mala taas yoota» gides.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:4">Addezikka izas, «Ta wozzana» gides.<verse eid="RUT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Hessafe guye Boo7eezey, «Histtiko neni gadeza Nuhaamippenne Mo7aabe as Urutippe ne wozzida gallas hayqqidayssa sunththiza biittan xeygisanaas iza machchiyokka ekka» gides.<verse eid="RUT 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Histtiin he mata dabbozikka zaaridi, «Hessa mala gidikko ta xinxxo meton yegganaas koyontta gishshas ta wozzanaas dandaykke; ne wozza» gides.<verse eid="RUT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Beni wode Isra7eele biittan oonikka ba aqo wozzana koykko woykko haras aaththi immana koykko he yo7ozi minnana dandayzay nam7aafe issoy ba caamma tohoppe shoddidi hankkoyssas immiko hanees. Isra7eele biittan shama gidiin woykko bayzo gidiin yo7oy minnizay hessa malanna. <verse eid="RUT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Hessa gishshas laatas bessiza mata dabbozi Boo7eezes, «Ne wozza» giidi ba caammaza tohoppe shoddi immides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:9">Zaare 25:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="RUT 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Boo7eezey cimatassinne dere ubbaas, «Tani Abimelekke aqotanne iza nayta Keloonenne Mahaloone aqota ubbaa Nuhaamippe shammidayssas hach intte wurikka markka. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Qasse hayqqidayssa sunththi isttaso asaa sunththa giddofe woykko katama asaa mazgabaappe dhayontta mala, iza sunththi iza xinxxo gaden xeygettana mala Mo7aabe dere maccassiyo Mahaloone machcho Uruto ta ekkadis; hessaska hach intte markka» gides.<verse eid="RUT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Hessafe guye katamaa penge dubbushan diza cimatinne asay wuri, «Ee, hayssas nuni markka! GODAY hanno neso yida maccassayo, Isra7eele asaas issifeteththan ooththida Eraheeli malanne Liya mala ooththo. Nenikka Efraatan dure as gida; ne sunththi Beeteliheemen eretto.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:31">Medhe 29:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />GODAY ne keeththaa ha lo7o yelaga maccassayfe nees immiza zereththan, Ti7imaara Yuhudas yelida Paareese keeththa asa mala ooththo» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 38:27-30">Medhe 38:27-30</ref></char></note><verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawite Yeleta Zarkke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Hessa gishshas Boo7eezey Uruto machcho ekkides; GODAY izis yelo immiin attuma naa yeladus. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Maccassatikka Nuhaamo, «Hach nena laattanaas mata dabbo dhayssontta GODAY galatetto! <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Naazi ne sunththaa ooraxissana! Ne cimmishinkka izi nena heemmana; gaasoykka nena siiqizaara laappun attuma naappeka aadhdhizaara ne naaza machcheya iza yeladus» gida.<verse eid="RUT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Hessafe guye Nuhaama qeeri naaza ekka idimmadus; histtada iza lo7aththa dichchadus. <verse eid="RUT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Izi gutan diza maccassati, «Nuhaamis attuma nay yelettides» gida; iza sunththaaka Iyoobeede gida. Izi Dawite yelida Isseye aawa.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Paareese soo asaa yeletay hayssafe kaalli dizayssa; Paareesey Hexiroome yelides; <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Hexiroomey Aaraame yelides; Aaraamey Aminadaabe yelides; <verse eid="RUT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Aminadaabey Ne7asoone yelides; Ne7asooney Salmmoone yelides; <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Salmmooney Boo7eeze yelides; Boo7eezey Iyoobeede yelides; <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Iyoobeedey Isseye yelides; Isseyey Dawite yelides.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>